sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Agent as Control Agent (Android App)
    participant OCR as OCR / AI Engine
    participant IVISS as IVISS Web Service
    participant EXTDB as External Vehicle DB (PostgreSQL 9.4)
    participant PARTNER as Partner APIs (Police, Insurance, Customs, etc.)
    participant MAINDB as IVISS Main DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant ADMIN as Back-Office Admin / Supervisor

    %% --- Control initiation ---
    Agent->>Agent: Start vehicle control
    Agent->>Agent: Choose input method\n(Manual / Photo / Continuous Scan)

    %% --- Plate acquisition ---
    alt Manual entry
        Agent->>IVISS: Send plate number
    else Photo or Continuous scan
        Agent->>OCR: Capture plate image
        OCR->>OCR: Image processing & OCR
        OCR->>Agent: Extracted plate number + confidence
        Agent->>IVISS: Send normalized plate number
    end

    %% --- Vehicle lookup ---
    IVISS->>EXTDB: Query vehicle by plate number
    alt Vehicle found
        EXTDB->>IVISS: Vehicle & registration data\n(chassis, owner, gray card, etc.)

        %% --- Status checks ---
        IVISS->>PARTNER: Check wanted / insurance /\ninspection / customs status
        PARTNER->>IVISS: Status responses

        %% --- Control result ---
        IVISS->>MAINDB: Save control record\n(user, phone, time, position, status)
        IVISS->>Agent: Display vehicle info & alerts\n(based on user rights)

    else Vehicle not found
        EXTDB-->>IVISS: No record found
        IVISS->>Agent: Request gray card capture

        %% --- Gray card capture ---
        Agent->>Agent: Film both sides of gray card
        Agent->>IVISS: Upload images + metadata
        IVISS->>MAINDB: Store pending registration data
        IVISS->>Agent: Acknowledge submission
    end

    %% --- Back-office processing ---
    ADMIN->>IVISS: Access back-office dashboard
    ADMIN->>IVISS: Review pending gray cards
    ADMIN->>EXTDB: Validate & update vehicle data
    ADMIN->>MAINDB: Log validation & audit trail

    %% --- Supervision & reporting ---
    ADMIN->>IVISS: View controls, statistics, reports
    IVISS->>MAINDB: Retrieve logs, audits, KPIs
    MAINDB->>ADMIN: Dashboards & exports
